1
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,320
Xie Nanfeng.

2
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,800
Will you marry me?

3
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,120
My life

4
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:42,560
has possibilities beyond love.

5
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,320
Right now,

6
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:48,320
I just want to be completely myself,

7
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,730
and build my career.

8
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:32,180
[She's Wild Fire]

9
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:37,250
[Episode 1: A New Life After the Fall]

10
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:43,020
[Year 2011]

11
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,479
Chang Yongbin,

12
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:50,080
you took away the factory
I built with my own hands,

13
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:51,820
drained all my hard work,

14
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:55,200
then dumped the entire mess on me,

15
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:57,240
leaving me with massive debts.

16
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,820
After all we've been through
as husband and wife,

17
00:01:58,820 --> 00:02:00,220
you should bear it for me.

18
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,960
If I could live my life over,

19
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,040
Chang Yongbin,

20
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:41,280
I'd make you pay a hundredfold

21
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:44,160
for all the pain you put me through.

22
00:02:52,329 --> 00:02:54,020
[Copy of Patent Registration]

23
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,680
Sign it.

24
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,360
Transfer your design patent to me.

25
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,070
Or don't blame me
for forcing myself on you

26
00:03:01,070 --> 00:03:02,730
and ruining your reputation.

27
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,040
I can't believe I've been reborn

28
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:08,360
20 years in the past, on this very day.

29
00:03:08,380 --> 00:03:11,800
[September 1, 1991]

30
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,480
I studied for 12 grueling years,

31
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,200
and finally earned a chance

32
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,260
to work at the First Garment Factory.

33
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:17,230
But that very night,

34
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:20,760
a beast raped me,

35
00:03:21,510 --> 00:03:23,310
stole my design patent,

36
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:26,700
and left me branded as a fallen woman.

37
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:30,520
I had no choice
but to marry Chang Yongbin.

38
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:34,760
My life hit rock bottom.

39
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,600
This time,

40
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:40,560
I can't let any of this happen again!

41
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,800
Get back here!

42
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:46,520
Get back here!

43
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:49,650
You wretched woman!

44
00:03:49,650 --> 00:03:51,450
Where do you think you're going?

45
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,490
You wretched woman!

46
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:08,680
Who was the man who ruined my reputation

47
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,760
twenty years ago?

48
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,680
Chang Yongbin?

49
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:27,750
Do you know what people say about me?

50
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:32,800
They say I married a disgraced woman.

51
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,600
So it was you.

52
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:38,520
Mom!

53
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,440
I didn't kill her.

54
00:04:40,909 --> 00:04:42,710
You framed me.

55
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,960
So it was you

56
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:47,240
who set me up in my past life.

57
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:49,080
I'll give you the factory

58
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,480
you've always dreamed of today.

59
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,920
But I'm not taking the blame for you.

60
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,450
I'll fight you to the death!

61
00:04:55,909 --> 00:04:56,909
It was you

62
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:59,080
who sent me to hell.

63
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,960
Once you're dead,

64
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:03,400
as your legal husband,

65
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,240
I'll be entitled to a fortune.

66
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,120
After all we've been
through as husband and wife,

67
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,050
do me this favor.

68
00:05:10,930 --> 00:05:11,810
It was you

69
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,720
who destroyed everything I had.

70
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,480
Chang Yongbin,

71
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,320
it was you

72
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,280
who violated me,

73
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:39,140
then tricked me into marrying you

74
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,800
and dragged me into hell.

75
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,360
You bastard!

76
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,600
You destroyed everything I had!

77
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,840
You bastard!

78
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,159
Nanfeng!

79
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,040
Nanfeng!

80
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,400
I just loved you too much.

81
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,360
You love me?

82
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:02,360
A scumbag like you
thinks you deserve to say that?

83
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:04,640
How many times do I have to tell you?

84
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,760
Why?

85
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:07,460
No, no!

86
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,150
This lash

87
00:06:10,130 --> 00:06:11,450
is payback

88
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,800
for the first time
you whipped me with a leather belt

89
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,730
just because I burned the food.

90
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,960
How many times do I have to tell you?

91
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,600
Let me go.

92
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,440
You burned the food!

93
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,690
Y-you, don't, don't hit me!

94
00:06:26,590 --> 00:06:27,590
This lash

95
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:30,000
is payback

96
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:33,820
for beating me into the ICU
just to bring your mistress,

97
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,360
Lin Shuang, into the house.

98
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,000
What are you talking about?

99
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,000
Don't hit me!

100
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,200
It hurts! Don't hit me.

101
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,730
This is nothing compared
to what you did to me.

102
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:43,880
Please!

103
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,000
This is only the interest.

104
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:52,159
Stop hitting me.

105
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:53,970
What do you want me to do?

106
00:06:54,159 --> 00:06:55,159
The interest.

107
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,040
Say it!

108
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,570
What do you want me to do?

109
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,120
The interest, Chang Yongbin.

110
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,360
I'm telling you to speak!

111
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,760
Don't hit me anymore!

112
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,240
Please.

113
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,120
I won't do it again.

114
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,720
Go ahead and savor
what it's like to be me.

115
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,650
Stop hitting me.

116
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,610
Stop hitting me.

117
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,180
Stop hitting me, Nanfeng.

118
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:14,660
I'll leave you another little reminder.

119
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,120
You can't be serious.

120
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,450
What are you going to do?

121
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,340
This reactive dye won't wash out.

122
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:23,480
I want everyone to see

123
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:25,690
what kind of man you really are.

124
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,640
No, no, no!

125
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,520
Nanfeng!

126
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,480
Xie Nanfeng!

127
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,800
Let go of me!

128
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,600
Xie Nanfeng!

129
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,600
I'm not letting you get away with this!

130
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,000
Put that down!

131
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,080
Xie Nanfeng!

132
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,800
I'm going to kill you!

133
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,280
I'll kill you!

134
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,360
You wretched woman!

135
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:45,120
I'm going to kill you today!

136
00:07:45,140 --> 00:07:46,140
Don't run!

137
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,320
Mr. Chu,

138
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:50,840
I heard that patent
is in the hands of an intern.

139
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:52,600
Then this factory
isn't even worth 5 million.

140
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:52,960
Stop right there!

141
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:53,800
Help!

142
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,560
Don't run!

143
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,360
Help!

144
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,060
Stop, you wretched woman!

145
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,600
You're safe now.

146
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:16,860
He won't be waking up anytime soon.

147
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,560
Chu Chunsheng?

148
00:08:21,290 --> 00:08:24,420
[President of Chu Group, Chu Chunsheng]

149
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:25,000
President of Chu Group,
one of the top 50 companies in Hong Kong.

150
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,840
In my previous life,
he was Chang Yongbin's investor.

151
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:30,000
After Chang Yongbin stole my patent,

152
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,039
he used Chu's investment

153
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:34,140
and became the factory director.

154
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:39,679
This time,

155
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,240
since I met you first,

156
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:42,720
you will be

157
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,920
the first step toward changing my fate.

158
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:22,750
What did you do to me?

159
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:36,390
What do you think
I could have done to you?

160
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:48,140
Is this how you thank
the man who saved your life?

161
00:09:52,770 --> 00:09:53,930
I remember now.

162
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:56,080
Last night,

163
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,080
you were the one who saved me.

164
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,080
So?

165
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,000
You want me

166
00:10:09,830 --> 00:10:11,310
to thank you like this?

167
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:15,480
Then I'll take this as an invitation.
